    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77803.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "So we've put forward a proposal. That's the way Congress works. The House, we've turned in our homework. It's done. And if the other side doesn't like it, there's a process for this. And that is the Senate should have passed a bill. They have it. They can't. And so that's why we find ourselves in this dilemma right now is because Leader Schumer and Democrats, and it really led by the President, Joe Biden, have refused to take this issue seriously.",
